  - 'Pharaoh: Speak, traveler. What brings you before the throne of the living sun '
  - 'Villager: Great pharaoh The Nile runs low, our crops wither, we beg for your
    mercy '
  - 'Pharaoh: The Nile obeys the gods, Why should i show favor to your village? '
  - 'Villager: Because we still serve you. We offer the little grain we have. We
    ask only for water.'
